# handler_callers.unshipped - web files of the source tree that NO Reaper image installs.
# Read by test_handler_callers.py: a caller found only in one of these files does not count.
# Made on 2026-11-21 by comparing the test's source model (www/ + the Reaper overlays - the Makefile's
# unconditional removals) with the www folder of 13 images: the v3.8.4 RT-BE96U test image and the 12 release
# images (RT-BE96U, RT-BE86U, RT-BE88U, GT-BE98_PRO, GT-BE98, GT-BE19000, BQ16, BQ16 Pro; four of them also on
# the 102.40585 alpha line). These are the pages a conditional line of www/Makefile removes on every Reaper
# model, and overlay files another file replaces. Text files only; one install path per line.
# When a page listed here ships again, take its line out (the test then counts its callers).
